n in the past four years.</p>"}, {"slug": "100-fastest-growing-companies", "title": "100 Fastest-Growing Companies", "year": 2020, "rank": 30, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "100-fastest-growing-companies", "title": "100 Fastest-Growing Companies", "year": 2014, "rank": 97, "itemDescription": ""}]}